Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-01-30T18:56:14Z","updated_at":"2025-01-30T18:56:14Z","body":"The MRP isn't a complete project, can you please provide a complete project to test this with","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2625323596/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2625442244","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/102200#issuecomment-2625442244","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102200","id":2625442244,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6cfRHE","user":{"login":"RonnieBCrud","id":149986985,"node_id":"U_kgDOCPCeqQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/149986985?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/RonnieBCrud","html_url":"https://github.com/RonnieBCrud","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RonnieBCrud/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RonnieBCrud/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RonnieBCrud/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RonnieBCrud/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RonnieBCrud/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RonnieBCrud/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RonnieBCrud/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RonnieBCrud/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RonnieBCrud/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-01-30T19:54:48Z","updated_at":"2025-01-30T19:54:48Z","body":"Well, I attached the scene and the script that specifically causes the problem so you can put it inside a project and see if the problem persists. I tried to migrate to another new project to attach it here in the form of a folder and .exe, but I see that it works without problems in another project. I searched for what causes the problem to appear in my personal project, but I found nothing. I noticed that in my project, if it doesn't crash at the start of the scene, the problem appears immediately if I touch the edge of the window, so I think it's a problem with the project settings.\n\nI copied all the settings from my personal project to the new project trying to find the problem, but it works without problems in the new one. So, I started looking for something in the plugins or singletons that could be the problem, so I started disabling everything and then enabling one by one trying to find the one that causes the problem.\n\nI noticed that singletons keep working even when they are disabled (I don't know if it's a bug), so I removed all of them from the project settings and then restarted the search.\n\nIn the end, I didn't find the problem that was causing the game to crash in my project. I isolated the scene making the rest of the project unusable, and it keeps happening, and I don't know why.\n\nI can't find a way to replicate the problem, initially I thought it was just that scene that I put inside another scene and then the game crashes. If I remove the scene, everything works fine. But now I think it's maybe something bigger than just one scene. Something in my project makes the whole game crash with that scene, something that doesn't happen in 4.3, so I still think there might be some bug on the engine's part.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2625442244/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2625446022","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/102200#issuecomment-2625446022","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102200","id":2625446022,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6cfSCG","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/A